WEBVTT

00:10:30.417 --> 00:10:33.629
Politics and profits
have always stamped out

00:10:33.629 --> 00:10:36.465
the promise of freedom.

00:10:37.675 --> 00:10:40.469
We can lock up migrants,

00:10:40.511 --> 00:10:43.222
but we don't have to.

00:10:43.889 --> 00:10:48.143
Instead of hoping
that barbed wire and steel doors

00:10:48.185 --> 00:10:52.815
will guide us out of the labyrinth
of immigration law,

00:10:52.815 --> 00:10:55.943
we could invest in justice.

00:10:56.777 --> 00:11:00.155
We could make sure that every migrant